	(descr "Marushin MJ-373/8B mini DIN 8-pin jack, PCB mount, hand-soldered (not JLC-assembled). Land pattern per Marushin drawing MJ373/8B-001 \"T:1.6 Dimensions of PC board holes (Printed-Top view)\": 8 holes phi1.2 in two columns 2.5mm apart (x=8.5 and x=11.0 from the mating face); column x=8.5: pin5 y=+3.25 pin2 y=+1.5 pin1 y=-1.5 pin3 y=-3.25; column x=11.0: pin8 y=+3.25 pin7 y=+1.0 pin4 y=-1.5 pin6 y=-3.25 (pin7 is offset 0.5mm, it is NOT in line with pin2); 3 shell/ground slots 2.8x0.8 R0.4: pad9 at (4.7,0) vertical, pad10/pad11 at (5.5,-6.85)/(5.5,+6.85) horizontal. Origin = mating face (x=0) on the centreline (y=0); body 12.7 deep, flange 14.0 wide x 13.0 high. Drawing y is positive upwards; KiCad y is negated here.")
